---
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# OPTIONAL. Nothing in the site depends on this file.
#
# On Apache-family servers (including LiteSpeed) it makes UNKNOWN URLs show the site's own 404 page.
# Without it, valid URLs work exactly the same and unknown URLs still return 404; the host just shows
# its default error page. Written for the root-domain build only.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
